# Copy to vm/policy/alert.url (no .example) to enable outbound alerts.
# The POST is host/where/rule only. Never the token.
#
# Fastest phone path, no account:
#   https://ntfy.sh/<long-random-topic>
# Subscribe in the ntfy app. A guessable topic is a public mailbox.
#
# Slack incoming-webhook and Discord webhook URLs also work.
